---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Kevin Ong — ML engineer, writer, cat person.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">About</h1>

    <div class="prose mx-auto">
      <p>
        Hi! I'm Kevin Ong, also known as <strong>lobakbro</strong> around the internet.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm a machine learning engineer based in San Francisco, California.
        My professional work centers on deep learning — building models, understanding architectures,
        and making ML systems work in production.
      </p>

      <p>
        Outside of work, I'm an active member of the LGBTQ+ and local Asian community.
        I have strong opinions about classical music (Rachmaninoff, Sibelius, and Mahler are the holy trinity),
        an unreasonable number of plants, and a deep appreciation for the perfect bowl of beef noodle soup
        — bun bo hue and Lanzhou la mian specifically.
      </p>

      <p>
        I write about all of this and more. This site is where technical deep-dives on ML
        coexist with essays on Bernstein's lectures and reflections on philosophy and life.
        If you're here for one thing, you might stay for another.
      </p>

      <p>
        This site is built with Astro and deployed on GitHub Pages.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
